- The Coverage Trade-Off: bezel covers the stone's edge. The Corner Shield: bezel protects the stone's corners perfectly. The 57-Review Standard: the most reviewed bezel in this dataset.

→ Best ring: [GIA 1ct D-VS1 at $3,140](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/29333987?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) + [Comfort Fit Bezel Solitaire Platinum $1,610](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/comfort-fit-bezel-set-solitaire-engagement-ring-in-platinum-by-james-allen-item-315706?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) = **$4,750**. Platinum bezel, 57 reviews, cleanest modern profile for an emerald cut.

